    "title": "Who Is Ewan McGregor’s Wife? Mary Elizabeth Winstead’s Job & Relationship History",
    "text": "Ewan McGregor was recently announced to be returning to the London theatre scene in April 2025’s My Master Builder by Wyndham Theatre. Earlier this year, he also co-starred in A Gentleman in Moscow with his wife Mary Elizabeth Winstead. Accordingly, interest in McGregor’s personal life has increased as fans wish to learn more about his marriage with Winstead.Here is everything you need to know about Ewan McGregor’s wife Mary Elizabeth Winstead and their marriage.Who is Ewan McGregor married to?Ewan McGregor is married to Mary Elizabeth Winstead.McGregor and Winstead were previously married to Eve Mavrakis and Riley Stearns, respectively. McGregor shares four children with Mavrakis.What is Mary Elizabeth Winstead’s job?Mary Elizabeth Winstead is an actor.Winstead’s most famous movies include Scott Pilgrim vs. The World, Birds of Prey, and Fargo. In 2023, she played Hera Syndulla in the Star Wars series Ahsoka.Ewan McGregor and Mary Elizabeth Winstead’s relationship historyEwan McGregor and his wife Mary Elizabeth Winstead reportedly first met on the set of FX’s Fargo in 2016. Here, Winstead played Swango while McGregor essayed the double role of twin brothers Emmit and Ray Stussy.Then one year later, McGregor and Winstead were spotted kissing in an outing at a London cafe (via The Sun). One month later, they were seen together at Los Angeles. Then few months later in January 2018, during his Golden Globes speech, where he won an award for his portrayal of Emmet and Ray in Fargo, he thanked Winstead. Few days later, they were seen locking lips at the Critics Choice Award.The two then continued dating, despite breakup rumors springing up at one point. Then in 2020, the couple worked together in the DECU film Birds of Prey, where Winstead played Huntress and McGregor took on the role of main villain Black Mask.Then in June 2021, the couple welcomed their first and currently only child together Laurie. Finally in April 2022, the two tied the knot. Later in 2024, the couple starred together in Paramount Plus’ A Gentleman in Moscow.The post Who Is Ewan McGregor’s Wife? Mary Elizabeth Winstead’s Job & Relationship History appeared first on ComingSoon.net - Movie Trailers, TV & Streaming News, and More.",
